  "details": "The game client hard freezes/crashes (deadlock) when trying to enter some instances with around 20 players. I am unsure if it is due to the number of players in the instance, but joining an empty instance of the same world works fine. The freeze/crash seems to happen near the end of the world loading, and then Windows detects the application as not responding anymore.\n\nGoing back to the public release branch (1554) and I can join the instance just fine, it is only an issue with the Open Beta branch (1564).\n\nI doubt it is an avatar in the instance, since the client freezes before the world finishes loading. I also doubt it is the world itself, since loading into the world when it is empty is no issue, and I have had the issue with multiple different worlds.\n\nThe only common thing I see in the logfile that makes me suspicious, is the two \"Holding recovery payload until all bunches are received.\" messages, since it could sound like cause for a deadlock.",
